id: variable-battlefield
name: Variable Battlefield
advancement: true
prerequisite: 8+ Insight Score
tpCost: 8
# "You may select any Magnitude between Standard and Destructive." Asked when it is used.
variableMagnitude: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Its Sphere any Magnitude from Standard to Destructive.
text: >
  Variable Battlefield: You can choose the size of your barrier.
  –Prerequisites: 8+ Insight Score
  –TP Cost: 8
  –Effect: When using the Bound Battlefield Unique Ability, you may select the Magnitude for its effect. You may select
  any Magnitude between Standard and Destructive.
